ext","block_id":"kz1kD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00185964-35cf-490a-b23e-6b397d9c8bae","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"出力ウィンドウを探して、そこで`:normal! G` させる？","ts":"1626788336.206400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BEm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02218511-4e06-40e5-9cdd-40990825887f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、お手軽にやる方法は今のところはなさそう…","ts":"1626788313.205700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3a25"}]},{"client_msg_id":"599c2519-5604-4f8f-a553-7d541d788008","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"autocmdでなんとかするのが楽そうかなあ","ts":"1626788298.205200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vYKi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d34275c-91bc-4cc1-bd5d-d9fdc02fa8bd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶん出力バッファに移動するのがめっちゃ面倒そう (決め打ちで良ければまあ)","ts":"1626788265.204500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PEq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bb35ca2-7c98-48b3-93dd-7d9ee72ff312","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"すごいヘルプだ","ts":"1626788260.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8256b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4056797c-3ab8-4209-9b4b-9bddd6496cfc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これを見ていた","ts":"1626788244.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/mb"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n実行順序                                        *quickrun-execution-sequence*\n \nモジュールを作成する上で、quickrun の内部の処理順序を知ることは重要です。以下\nは quickrun のおおまかな実行順序です。\n \n1.  config の構築\n    コマンドライン引数、各種オプション変数などから config を構築します。この時\n    点では指定されなかった一部のオプションが存在していない可能性があります。\n2.  hook の構築\n    hook モジュールを生成します。この時 |quickrun-module.init()| が呼ばれま\n    す。ここ以降でエラーが発生した場合は多くの場合 |quickrun-session.sweep()|\n    が呼ばれます。ただし、非同期実行などでうまく呼ばれないかもしれません。\n3.  |quickrun-hook-point-hook_loaded| の実行\n4.  無効な hook 削除\n    この時点で enable オプションが 0 な hook は {session} から取り除かれます。\n5.  config の標準化\n    config 内の |quickrun-syntax-option| を展開したり、いくつかの必要なオプ\n    ションがなかった場合に補完します。ファイルが直接実行できない場合に一時ファ\n    イルへ書き出す処理もここで行います。\n6.  |quickrun-hook-point-normalized| の実行\n7.  runner/outputter の構築\n    runner モジュールと outputter モジュールを生成します。hook の時と同様に\n    |quickrun-module.init()| が呼ばれます。\n8.  |quickrun-hook-point-module_loaded| の実行\n9.  コマンドの構築\n    |quickrun-option-exec| の値を実際に実行するコマンドに展開します。\n10. |quickrun-hook-point-ready| の実行\n11. |quickrun-outputter.start()| の実行\n12. |quickrun-runner.run()| の実行\n13. |quickrun-session.finish()| の実行\n    非同期実行の場合は runner が直接呼び出す必要があります。\n14. |quickrun-hook-point-success| / |quickrun-hook-point-failure| の実行\n15. |quickrun-hook-point-finish| の実行\n16. |quickrun-outputter.finish()| の実行\n17. |quickrun-session.sweep()| の実行\n18. |quickrun-hook-point-exit| の実行\n```","ts":"1626788242.203700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e042ce6f-6288-48ed-8de3-306bd0e88a8c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h quickrun-execution-sequence","ts":"1626788241.203600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nzIO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"879cf056-f59c-4a0d-b3bc-436a53d602a8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(ちなみに呼び出し方は全く分からない)","ts":"1626788216.203300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9FXX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee27fdf0-1fbb-43ed-bfbb-17895e656c8c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ使えない？","ts":"1626788196.203000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I8bW+"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n- \"exit\"                                *quickrun-hook-point-exit*\n  後処理が終わった後の処理の終了時です。\n \nこれら以外に、モジュールが |quickrun-session.invoke_hook()| を使うことで任意の\nタイミングでフックを発生させることができます。\n```","ts":"1626788190.202800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"250e05ea-1144-43a9-8e4b-041609e7260d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h quickrun-hook-point-exit","ts":"1626788189.202700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mTX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7def7fa3-99e3-467f-9df3-16fafc2348b5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Filetype quickrunで(qf/loclistでないとして)、なんかautocmdで細工したらいけるかな?","ts":"1626788173.202400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rhg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"699ed61a-8b9a-4b82-86ab-de78d5a8df82","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どうだったかな…詳しい人いるかな","ts":"1626788102.201400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01D9BALEKU","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cSIu1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a927a07-7204-49c4-9bb1-d1bc634ca6a5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"出力が長いと下のほうが見切れると思うんですが、そもそも下がみたいというか","ts":"1626788098.201300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aCHQ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bc2e09d-04dd-4296-a586-93a736ac498c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"quickrunの実行後に実行結果のウィンドウでカーソルが下に来ててほしいのですが、これってできますか？","ts":"1626788061.200300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AtdfX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7de599a1-753f-4059-802a-de7513a09f43","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"別の質問ですが","ts":"1626788031.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V",