umentation_float = 0` これも一緒に","ts":"1626711840.186100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aj3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"306e3ab1-453e-4a4b-b4de-318cd3da42c6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"下のほうが見えなくなるっていうかカーソル位置まで全部覆われてしまうことがあるｗ","ts":"1626711823.185800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=M1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"141fab5f-541c-4cfb-869d-e3ddf0b5a336","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"他のオプションと絡んでるのかな…。","ts":"1626711812.185500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aK4mt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f195588a-de45-4812-b8d2-eb7b47f43f94","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こちらもだめでした","ts":"1626711786.184600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df1ba921-29b1-4a43-ade6-386d7f4615cb","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いや出ますね","ts":"1626711775.184400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rU8b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41249f6a-c906-4514-923f-e9a99cd28514","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"んーいやこれは起動時に設定されてないとダメか？","ts":"1626711618.184200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eYj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"384c2979-cfca-4163-8778-72950c55c595","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"doubletap=0したけど出ますね","ts":"1626711605.183900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yNc=g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecb395fc-985b-44e0-9dfb-d4f849297119","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"手元でオフってるんですが、これをコメントして `let g:lsp_preview_float = 0` にしたら↑と同じように再現して大変鬱陶しくなりましたw","ts":"1626711577.183500","team":"T03C4RC8V","repl